@base <http://ecareathome-ontology.mpi.aass.oru.se/patterns/SmartHome_Place.owl> .

<http://ecareathome-ontology.mpi.aass.oru.se/patterns/SmartHome_Place.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                            owl:imports <http://ecareathome-ontology.mpi.aass.oru.se/patterns/SmartHome_Geometry.owl> ,
                                                                                        <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/schemas/cpannotationschema.owl> ;
                                                                            terms:description "To represent a SmartHome as a place (specialization of http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#PhysicalPlace) which contains a number of sections (other physical places) and is also seen as a platform (e.g. a platform for a sensor network)."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                            terms:title "Smarthome Place Pattern"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                            cpannotationschema:coversRequirements "How many and what sections are there in the SmartHome?"^^xsd:string ,
                                                                                                                  "What are the spatial/directional relations between sections of a smart home?"^^xsd:string ,
                                                                                                                  "Which physical objects are located in a section of a smart environment?"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                            cpannotationschema:hasIntent "To represent a SmartHome as a place (specialization of http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#PhysicalPlace) which contains a number of sections (other physical places) and is also seen as a platform (e.g. a platform for a sensor network)."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                            cpannotationschema:isSpecializationOf "The pattern extends both the SSN ontology and DUL. The extension is in the form of specialization of the two classes: http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/ssn#Platform and http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#PhysicalPlace."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                            rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x16; term declared x6;
- header: dcterms:title \"Smarthome Place Pattern\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en ;
                                                                            rdfs:isDefinedBy "This pattern also used the ODP Geometry (http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/wiki/Submissions:SmartHome_Geometry) to represent the spatial and directional relations between existing sections in a smart home."^^xsd:string .

